==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[inverse]] [[matrix]]|inverse matrices}}

# {{context|linear algebra|lang=en}} Of a [[matrix]] A, another matrix B such that A multiplied by B and B multiplied by A both equal the [[identity matrix]].<!--Note: matrix multiplication is not commutative, so B x A is not the same as A x B; both of the stated conditions must hold for matrix B to be the inverse matrix of matrix A-->

====Synonyms====
* [[inverse]]

